.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release \- Answer whether a release is installable as it says it is
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Answer whether a release is installable as it says it is
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-release\-install(1)
Decide whether install.sh, the release matrix and the binstall manifest agree on every asset name, and that no binary is committed
.TP
batten\-release\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
